WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.140
If your prep is suprep, this video will walk you through exactly how to take it

2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:04.840
. Just follow

3
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.760
along step by step.

4
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:10.500
Your bowel prep kit comes with two small bottles and a mixing container.

5
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.750
You'll use one bottle the evening before your procedure and the second bottle

6
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.400
the morning

7
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.400
of.

8
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.360
You'll also need water.

9
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.370
For your first dose between 5 and 6 pm the evening before your colonoscopy,

10
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.280
pour the entire

11
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.880
contents of the first bottle into the mixing container provided.

12
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:29.350
Fill the container with water to the 16 oz fill line and drink the entire

13
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:29.680
amount.

14
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.160
After you finish, continue to drink 16 to 32 oz of clear liquids until you go

15
00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:34.640
to bed.

16
00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:39.800
Remember, do not drink red, orange, blue or purple liquids.

17
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.370
For your second dose, 7 hours before your procedure time, pour the entire

18
00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:44.000
contents of

19
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.560
the second bottle into the mixing container.

20
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.000
Fill with water to the 16 oz fill line and drink the entire amount.

21
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.710
After finishing this second dose, drink an additional 32 oz of water within 1

22
00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:56.240
hour.

23
00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.240
Do not have any liquids at all within 4 hours of your procedure.

24
00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.750
You must drink all of the prep solution as

25
00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:04.720
directed, even

26
00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:07.000
if you're already passing clear liquid.

27
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.370
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

28
00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.080
the clearest

29
00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:13.200
view during your procedure.

30
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:16.630
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither

31
00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:16.840
of

32
00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:18.280
us wants that.

33
00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:20.880
Staying hydrated throughout the process is key.

34
00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.160
Make sure you're drinking plenty of clear liquids between your doses.

35
00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:27.910
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

36
00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:28.880
a petroleum-based

37
00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.560
ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

38
00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.560
That's it, you've got this.

39
00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:37.120
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated.

40
00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:40.800
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office.

41
00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.440
We're here to help.
